    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "Yayasan controls the renewal outcome", "items": [
      "The principal records Yayasan's decision locally after submission; no remote Yayasan API is invoked.",
      "Approved plus renew creates the next contract. Rejected OR a not_renew recommendation closes both contract and teacher as not_renewed.",
      "A recommendation decision is required to submit. Uploading a recommendation letter is supported, but the submit method does not require its file."
