    { "dot": "emerald", "title": "Exact tier progression and dates", "items": [
      "PKWT-I -> PKWT-II; PKWT-II -> PKWT-III or Guru SK; PKWT-III -> Guru SK.",
      "New contract starts the day after the old end date, or today if no end exists. PKWT duration is one year; Guru SK has no end date.",
      "The old contract becomes renewed; teacher.status becomes the next type. Probation Continue does not spawn a contract or enforce an additional renewal gate."
